<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<!--
    About page (clone round 12 §6 F6). A ROUTED page — the tab bar stays FOUR
    tabs; this is pushed from the title-bar About button and the platform's own
    back gesture returns.

    The cable / connector / pinout facts come from the OLD WinForms app's About
    box and are carried VERBATIM as constants in Falcon.App.Core's AboutContent
    (which also carries the ledger of what was adjusted and what was dropped).
    They are bound with x:Static rather than spelled here so the host test suite
    — which has no MAUI head and cannot read a rendered page — can pin them
    byte-exact, and so a later edit cannot change the wiring facts in the markup
    without changing what the tests read.

    The VERSION is the running app's own (AppInfo), set in code-behind.

    ROUND 13 C1 (backlog item 12, owner 2026-08-19) — three changes, one page:

    1. THIS PAGE'S OWN Shell.TitleView, [app icon][About]. That is the whole
       recursion fix: the shell's title view carries an About button, and while
       About INHERITED it, pressing it pushed another About onto the stack,
       without limit. A page-level TitleView overrides the shell's for this page
       only, so the button is simply not there to press — and the page's
       Title="About" becomes what the operator reads. AppShell.xaml is NOT
       touched (every other page still gets the button).
    2. Shell.TabBarIsVisible="False" locks out the tab bar while About is up
       (Windows: the top strip; Android: the bottom bar). It is an ATTACHED
       property of this page, so it dies with the page — a navigation that
       replaces About restores the bar by construction.
    3. The PICTURE from the old app's About box (falconrc_about.png, extracted
       from About.resx's logoPictureBox.Image). AspectFit + a MAXIMUM width of
       507 — the old box's rendered width — so it never upscales past its
       intrinsic box, and shrinks to fit a phone.

    The credit line is a BYLINE now, not a "based on" notice (the owner is
    W6HOS). Its year is the CURRENT year, composed in code-behind from
    AboutContent.CreditPrefix — hence x:Name here rather than an x:Static bind.
-->
<ContentPage xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/dotnet/2021/maui"
             xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2009/xaml"
             xmlns:vm="clr-namespace:Falcon.App.Core.ViewModels;assembly=Falcon.App.Core"
             x:Class="Falcon.App.Views.AboutPage"
             Title="About"
             Shell.TabBarIsVisible="False">

    <Shell.TitleView>
        <Grid ColumnDefinitions="Auto,*" ColumnSpacing="8">
            <Image Source="falconrc_icon.png"
                   HeightRequest="24"
                   WidthRequest="24"
                   VerticalOptions="Center"
                   SemanticProperties.Description="FalconRC" />
            <Label Grid.Column="1" Text="About" Style="{StaticResource StatusText}" VerticalOptions="Center" />
        </Grid>
    </Shell.TitleView>

    <ScrollView>
        <!-- 2026-08-23 (owner ask, with SettingsPage): the root stack FILLS on
             every idiom — Default=Start shrank the cards to content width on
             desktop. The photo's own 507 MAXIMUM cap stays: the cards span,
             the picture still never upscales past its intrinsic box. -->
        <VerticalStackLayout Padding="{OnIdiom Default=16, Phone=12}" Spacing="12"
                             HorizontalOptions="Fill">

            <Border Style="{StaticResource Card}">
                <VerticalStackLayout Spacing="8">
                    <Image Source="falconrc_about.png"
                           Aspect="AspectFit"
                           MaximumWidthRequest="507"
                           SemanticProperties.Description="Photograph of the Falcon radio family and its accessories" />
                    <Label Text="FalconRC" Style="{StaticResource CardHeading}" />
                    <Label x:Name="VersionLabel" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" />
                    <Label Text="{x:Static vm:AboutContent.Description}" />
                </VerticalStackLayout>
            </Border>

            <Border Style="{StaticResource Card}">
                <VerticalStackLayout Spacing="8">
                    <Label Text="{x:Static vm:AboutContent.CableHeading}" Style="{StaticResource CardHeading}" />
                    <Label Text="{x:Static vm:AboutContent.CableRecommended}" />
                    <Label Text="{x:Static vm:AboutContent.CableAlternate}" />
                    <Label Text="{x:Static vm:AboutContent.MatingConnector}" />
                    <Label Text="{x:Static vm:AboutContent.PinoutGround}" />
                    <Label Text="{x:Static vm:AboutContent.PinoutTx}" />
                    <Label Text="{x:Static vm:AboutContent.PinoutRx}" />
                </VerticalStackLayout>
            </Border>

            <!-- OWNER 2026-08-23: the old About box's keyboard-tuning tip,
                 back and reworded to this app's own gesture (the AboutContent
                 ledger has the history). WINDOWS ONLY: Android has no
                 keyboard path (ui.md — "Android has no keyboard path"). -->
            <Label Text="{x:Static vm:AboutContent.FrequencyTip}"
                   Style="{StaticResource Caption}"
                   IsVisible="{OnPlatform Default=False, WinUI=True}" />

            <Label x:Name="CreditLabel" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" />

        </VerticalStackLayout>
    </ScrollView>
</ContentPage>
